WEBVTT

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:08.610
I don't need you to play the role 
of the new Finé anymore.

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:11.030
Mom, what are you talking about?

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:13.860
You are Maria Cadenzavna Eve.

00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:16.870
You are only gentle Maria,

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.870
without Finé's soul within you.

00:00:22.410 --> 00:00:24.260
Finé's soul

00:00:24.260 --> 00:00:26.700
did not enter any of the vessels...

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:28.380
That's all.

00:02:10.020 --> 00:02:14.480
<b>Episode 8 
Hand in Hand for Me, as I Waver...</b>

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:57.230
<i>I tilted my head and saw the love 
slipping through my fingers.</i>

00:02:57.230 --> 00:03:02.420
<i>If I picked it up and piled it up, 
would it reach to the Moon?</i>

00:03:01.740 --> 00:03:05.490
Maria, this is a private channel between us.

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:09.410
<i>Realism mixed with errors, educating my DNA.</i>

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.870
Shirabe and Kirika

00:03:09.410 --> 00:03:15.430
<i>A monochrome prison in which 
I just bow my head like a doll.</i>

00:03:09.870 --> 00:03:12.420
cannot hear us.

00:03:12.830 --> 00:03:14.360
This again?

00:03:14.360 --> 00:03:16.450
You want me to pretend to be Finé?

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:21.940
<i>That's why I'm going to slice this world to pieces.</i>

00:03:17.260 --> 00:03:19.990
Our plan requires

00:03:19.990 --> 00:03:22.680
Dr. Ver's assistance.

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:25.180
To get his help,

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:31.900
<i>To protect someone, I must believe 
that true strength is courage,</i>

00:03:25.610 --> 00:03:29.250
we need him to believe that Finé's 
soul has been reborn within you,

00:03:29.250 --> 00:03:34.870
and that we are at the cutting edge
 of heretical technology research.

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:35.190
<i>and dream of those tales.</i>

00:03:35.190 --> 00:03:39.080
<i>I've almost forgotten that smile.</i>

00:03:35.430 --> 00:03:36.630
It's impossible!

00:03:36.630 --> 00:03:39.570
Yes, we are Receptor Children,

00:03:39.080 --> 00:03:42.360
<i>But it's okay, I can still fly.</i>

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:43.860
orphans intended as vessels for Finé's soul...

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:50.080
<i>I'll hold these shining bonds close, 
singing a melody!</i>

00:03:44.400 --> 00:03:47.660
But in reality, we could not hold it.

00:03:47.900 --> 00:03:49.420
I cannot do that now!

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.610
The Symphogear system.

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:11.500
What a splendid power.

00:04:12.130 --> 00:04:15.810
And the improved LiNKER I created, 
which gives the power to fight

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:18.310
to you girls with low compatibility values...

00:04:18.310 --> 00:04:20.400
With this power,

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.400
you can be the heroes the world needs.

00:04:29.300 --> 00:04:33.790
<i>But Mom said I didn't need to 
pretend to be Finé anymore.</i>

00:04:35.000 --> 00:04:37.660
<i>The Shenshoujin and the Nephilim heart...</i>

00:04:38.060 --> 00:04:40.720
<i>With the keys to Frontier in our hands,</i>

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:45.870
<i>why did Mom say I didn't need to lie anymore?</i>

00:04:56.920 --> 00:05:01.370
The irregular values caused by the 
overdose have finally stabilized.

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:03.060
Good.

00:05:03.060 --> 00:05:05.700
Now we won't slow you down any longer.

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:09.570
In addition to using LiNKER to create wielders,

00:05:09.570 --> 00:05:12.760
maintaining them and managing their 
conditions is also part of your job.

00:05:12.760 --> 00:05:14.500
We need you to carry it out.

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:16.550
I know.

00:05:16.550 --> 00:05:19.420
Of course, I'll take care of you, as well.

00:05:27.520 --> 00:05:28.180
Huh?

00:05:32.680 --> 00:05:35.280
What's going on?

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:40.150
<i>Did I do that?</i>

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:45.740
<i>How did I...</i>

00:05:47.750 --> 00:05:48.790
<i>Is that...</i>

00:05:54.630 --> 00:05:57.670
This is a scan of Hibiki-kun's body.

00:05:58.250 --> 00:06:00.050
The Gungnir in her body

00:06:00.050 --> 00:06:03.180
has worked its way deeper, and has multiplied

00:06:03.480 --> 00:06:05.920
to the point that it's created a new organ.

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:09.600
This is the source of her vast power,

00:06:10.100 --> 00:06:12.240
and the thing that eats away at her life.

00:06:16.300 --> 00:06:18.530
In other words, each time

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:21.230
I activate the Gungnir in my chest, it fuses with me.

00:06:21.500 --> 00:06:25.040
So you want me to use it as little as possible.

00:06:25.850 --> 00:06:27.240
Enough!

00:06:27.540 --> 00:06:28.770
"As little as possible"?

00:06:28.770 --> 00:06:30.360
Don't be stupid!

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:33.860
We're telling you that you're forbidden 
from ever fighting again!

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.250
Tsubasa-san...

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:39.290
You're going to die, Tachibana!

00:06:40.710 --> 00:06:42.670
That's enough!

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:44.950
This dummy knows what she's doing.

00:06:51.050 --> 00:06:53.380
Our medical teams aren't completely useless.

00:06:53.770 --> 00:06:56.390
They're using the data Ryouko-kun left,

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:58.370
to search for a solution.

00:06:59.390 --> 00:07:00.770
Master...

00:07:01.140 --> 00:07:03.690
We'll find a cure soon.

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:08.270
Until that happens, there's nothing 
wrong with a short vacation.

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.780
So, for now, rest.

00:07:11.560 --> 00:07:13.660
I understand...

00:07:16.730 --> 00:07:19.450
<i>A sword has no need for tears!</i>

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:22.800
<i>So why can I not stop crying?</i>

00:07:23.940 --> 00:07:25.230
<i>Am I no longer</i>

00:07:25.530 --> 00:07:28.500
<i>a sword to protect my comrades?</i>

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:30.260
Tsubasa-san?

00:07:31.110 --> 00:07:32.290
I know...

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:35.150
I have several interviews today, don't I?

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:36.930
Tsubasa-san!

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:39.060
I can go on my own.

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:41.110
Please do not worry about me.

00:07:52.660 --> 00:07:54.740
Maria, proceed.

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:03.870
Shuttle marker deployed.

00:08:04.160 --> 00:08:05.660
Cut stealth.

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:08.130
Gather the Shenshoujin's energy.

00:08:19.630 --> 00:08:23.640
The Shenshoujin, excavated from 
Nagano Prefecture's Mt. Minakami,

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:25.540
is a mirror relic.

00:08:26.140 --> 00:08:31.080
It has the ability to warp light, 
blending into surrounding areas,

00:08:31.080 --> 00:08:36.040
and ancient texts speak of
 its power to exorcise evil.

00:08:55.260 --> 00:09:00.810
With the Shenshoujin's ability 
to neutralize a relic's power,

00:09:01.090 --> 00:09:04.310
we will undo the seal on Frontier.

00:09:06.160 --> 00:09:09.070
Breaking the seal on Frontier

00:09:09.070 --> 00:09:11.730
means revealing its existence.

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:15.630
We can wait for our preparations 
to be completed, can't we?

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.560
There's no need to worry.

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:22.310
Remover Ray, discharge.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:35.170
This will break the seal on the Frontier...

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:38.180
It will break the seal!

00:09:50.840 --> 00:09:51.980
Break the...

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:06.930
It isn't breaking the seal?

00:10:09.610 --> 00:10:11.380
I-It isn't...

00:10:11.640 --> 00:10:14.050
It isn't breaking the seal?

00:10:14.860 --> 00:10:16.560
There isn't enough power.

00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:19.740
Even the Shenshoujin's power

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:22.420
cannot break the seal

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:27.180
on Frontier with its mechanical amplification.

00:10:27.630 --> 00:10:29.420
Did you know this?

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:32.420
You're an authority on relics.

00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:36.520
It's impossible that you came here 
to research, and yet knew nothing.

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:43.580
This experiment's purpose was to demonstrate
 that we are far from breaking Frontier's seal!

00:10:43.580 --> 00:10:44.950
Am I wrong?

00:10:45.750 --> 00:10:49.000
I'm about to tell you something very important.

00:11:01.830 --> 00:11:03.970
It's fake?

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:04.980
Yes.

00:11:05.280 --> 00:11:08.150
We've confirmed that NASA's official figures

00:11:08.150 --> 00:11:10.850
for the lunar orbit have a minor deviation.

00:11:11.410 --> 00:11:15.420
The error is an extremely small one, but it's clear.

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:19.290
And what this deviation means is that...

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:24.190
We can't trust the US government's 
official announcement that

00:11:24.540 --> 00:11:27.300
the damage caused by the Lunar Attack

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:31.800
won't affect the Moon's orbit for several centuries?

00:11:32.460 --> 00:11:37.460
To save as many innocent lives as possible 
from being lost to the falling Moon.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:41.680
No... FIS took action because

00:11:41.680 --> 00:11:44.100
it will fall before very long.

00:11:58.100 --> 00:12:02.820
I don't need you to play the role 
of the new Finé anymore.

00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:05.620
Mom, what did that mean?

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:07.610
Just what I said.

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:09.780
What we've done is

00:12:09.780 --> 00:12:12.330
simply to play at being terrorists.

00:12:12.840 --> 00:12:14.890
Our true task is to

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:18.670
find a way to minimize the damage 
caused by the Moon's impact.

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:20.090
Am I wrong?

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:24.590
In other words, we cannot save 
the world right now?

00:12:31.760 --> 00:12:33.810
Mom, what...

00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:36.540
Agents of the US government.

00:12:36.910 --> 00:12:40.360
I've brought them here to discuss peace.

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:43.430
You intend to make peace?

00:12:43.830 --> 00:12:46.540
I have already informed Dr. Ver.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:50.370
Now, let us hold a very important discussion.

00:13:03.980 --> 00:13:06.800
You're going to die, Tachibana!

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:12.390
<i>Die...</i>

00:13:12.830 --> 00:13:14.550
<i>If I fight, I'll die.</i>

00:13:15.070 --> 00:13:17.560
<i>Now that I think about it, that's natural.</i>

00:13:18.190 --> 00:13:21.170
<i>But at some point, I'd just grown numb to it.</i>

00:13:21.170 --> 00:13:24.570
<i>The possibility seemed so remote.</i>

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:28.280
<i>If I don't fight,</i>

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:31.590
<i>will no one need me?</i>

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:40.400
Don't be loud.

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:43.150
B-B-But anyone would yell

00:13:43.150 --> 00:13:44.980
if you did that to them...

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:46.900
It's your fault, Hibiki.

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:48.180
Mine?

00:13:48.180 --> 00:13:51.850
We came here to have fun,

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:53.850
but you look so bored.

00:13:55.640 --> 00:13:56.850
Sorry...

00:13:56.850 --> 00:13:58.770
Don't worry!

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.990
It's been forever since we've had a date.

00:14:00.990 --> 00:14:02.730
Of course it's fun!

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:04.740
Hibiki?

00:14:05.580 --> 00:14:09.160
I believe that the peaceful time 
she shares with you

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:12.980
is the one thing that can stop 
Gungnir from taking her over.

00:14:13.930 --> 00:14:15.450
Let's continue our date!

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:17.040
We don't come to Sky Tower every day...

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.790
We've gotta enjoy everything!

00:14:26.340 --> 00:14:28.550
It tastes just like I thought it would.

00:14:35.990 --> 00:14:37.650
<i>Reincarnation...</i>

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:42.330
<i>If the soul of Finé is really within me,</i>

00:14:42.630 --> 00:14:46.070
<i>does that mean my soul will disappear?</i>

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:48.400
<i>Wait a second...</i>

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:51.360
<i>If I'm the vessel for Finé's soul,</i>

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:53.330
<i>then how can Maria be Finé?</i>

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:55.060
Kiri-chan?

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:57.600
Lunch is ready.

00:14:57.600 --> 00:14:59.250
Th-Thanks!

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.380
What did you make?

00:15:01.730 --> 00:15:03.380
298 yen.

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:05.250
A feast!

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:07.670
Is the doctor out on some kind of mission?

00:15:07.670 --> 00:15:09.230
I don't see him.

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:10.580
I don't know,

00:15:10.580 --> 00:15:12.150
and I don't care!

00:15:12.150 --> 00:15:16.010
Let's eat while we don't have to look at his face!

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:23.770
Thank you for giving us the data 
on the heretical technology.

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:25.850
I'll tell you how

00:15:25.850 --> 00:15:28.320
to use it at another time.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.400
Until then...

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:31.410
Mom!

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.630
A bullet can take a life far faster,

00:15:33.630 --> 00:15:37.540
and with less hesitation, than your songs.

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:39.850
So from the start,

00:15:39.850 --> 00:15:42.670
you had no intention of making a deal?

00:15:43.020 --> 00:15:45.290
We have what we need.

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:48.120
All we have to do is dispose of what we don't.

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:51.340
Noise?

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:06.690
Everyone is so selfish.

00:16:15.040 --> 00:16:22.830
<i>Granzizel bilfen Gungnir zizzl.</i>

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:31.550
<i>Kort el fes Gungnir! Kort el fes Gungnir!</i>

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:54.330
<i>The fire of conviction dwells within my breast,</i>

00:16:54.930 --> 00:17:01.000
<i>an eternal blaze that no one can extinguish.</i>

00:17:01.000 --> 00:17:06.950
<i>Even if my body burns to ash...</i>

00:17:04.220 --> 00:17:05.110
Huh?

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:08.580
Is that Noise?

00:17:06.950 --> 00:17:13.760
<i>For the path that I believe in, 
I shall become one with heaven.</i>

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:09.710
Run!

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:12.650
Don't go! Please don't go!

00:17:12.650 --> 00:17:14.970
Miku... But I have to go!

00:17:14.690 --> 00:17:17.640
<i>On nights when I'm lost within the darkness,</i>

00:17:15.230 --> 00:17:16.780
I won't let you go.

00:17:17.080 --> 00:17:18.850
I don't want to let you fight!

00:17:17.640 --> 00:17:19.860
<i>shall I bring light with a song?</i>

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:20.990
I don't want you to leave me!

00:17:20.440 --> 00:17:23.490
<i>A serenade of holy light.</i>

00:17:21.350 --> 00:17:23.490
Mommy, where are you?

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:26.510
Mommy! I'm scared!

00:17:23.490 --> 00:17:27.910
<i>May power dwell within me...</i>

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:29.820
If I don't use the Gungnir in my chest, I'll be fine.

00:17:29.820 --> 00:17:30.860
If I don't go...

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:32.520
Hibiki...

00:17:42.950 --> 00:17:48.640
<i>An invincible blade, with no need for tears.</i>

00:17:48.960 --> 00:18:00.310
<i>If you're ready to face me now, 
then make a vow to your pride!</i>

00:18:06.940 --> 00:18:12.290
<i>For whose sake does my voice resound?</i>

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:18.860
<i>And for whom should this song be?</i>

00:18:18.860 --> 00:18:24.970
<i>I decided I'd never lose anything again...</i>

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:23.170
Maria, let's try to escape

00:18:23.170 --> 00:18:25.870
via the upper floors, to avoid an ambush.

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:31.460
<i>The miracle of my feelings will shatter my destiny.</i>

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:35.990
Come on... A boy shouldn't cry.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:38.040
<i>Lives whose hearts beat in battle,</i>

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:38.040
Don't worry. If you evacuate

00:18:38.040 --> 00:18:40.640
with everyone else, you'll see your mom!

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:44.680
<i>bring your love together, as the cadenza plays.</i>

00:18:40.870 --> 00:18:41.850
Are you okay?

00:18:42.350 --> 00:18:43.610
Hurry, this way.

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:45.640
You guys hurry, too.

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:54.590
<i>There is a fight that I cannot lose.</i>

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:52.520
Watch out!

00:18:54.590 --> 00:19:00.360
<i>Sing, world! Sing of tomorrow!</i>

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:05.090
<i>The future we'll learn will—</i>

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:09.950
<i>Toward the light-filled dawn sky,</i>

00:19:09.950 --> 00:19:14.720
<i>bring blessings to everyone.</i>

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:17.800
Maria...

00:19:20.450 --> 00:19:21.640
It's my fault.

00:19:24.610 --> 00:19:27.350
It's all my fault for not being able

00:19:27.350 --> 00:19:31.350
to bear Finé within me!

00:19:43.670 --> 00:19:45.450
Thanks, Miku...

00:19:47.220 --> 00:19:48.740
Um, Hibiki—

00:19:53.090 --> 00:19:54.000
Hibiki!

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:14.520
No! Don't hurt us!

00:20:14.760 --> 00:20:16.210
Don't hurt us!

00:20:16.210 --> 00:20:17.020
Stay calm!

00:20:18.400 --> 00:20:19.910
Stay calm! Go!

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:24.090
Stay calm!

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:27.860
<i>Those words weren't for anyone else.</i>

00:20:27.860 --> 00:20:29.960
<i>They were for me.</i>

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:32.070
Maria...

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:34.990
I won't hesitate anymore.

00:20:35.660 --> 00:20:37.290
I shall end this right now!

00:20:46.050 --> 00:20:48.400
Miku! It isn't safe there!

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:49.470
Let go!

00:20:49.470 --> 00:20:50.360
No!

00:20:50.360 --> 00:20:52.480
I have to protect you!

00:20:53.150 --> 00:20:54.040
Miku...

00:20:59.380 --> 00:21:03.080
Someday, when I'm really in trouble...

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:05.650
You can save me then.

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:10.240
So let me do a bit more on my own today.

00:21:17.420 --> 00:21:18.680
I...

00:21:19.440 --> 00:21:20.990
I want to protect you, too!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.960
Hibiki!

00:21:28.960 --> 00:21:36.410
<i>Balwisyall nescell Gungnir tron.</i>

00:21:53.950 --> 00:21:55.500
Miku, I'm coming!

00:22:02.880 --> 00:22:08.350
Miku!
